From 61b7f932e0973c26dae87abc3568d022ef86ba0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lucas Garfield <lucas@local>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:08:57 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] image-builder: link bootc container SBOMs from the
 registry (prototype)

With --with-sbom and --bootc-ref, look up the SPDX SBOM published for the
bootc container (and the installer payload container) at the resolved
digest: OCI referrers first, then the cosign "<alg>-<hex>.sbom" tag,
platform manifest digest before index digest. The fetched SBOMs are written
next to the image SBOM and referenced as external documents; the image root
CONTAINS each root they describe.

--bootc-ref-sbom and --bootc-payload-ref-sbom override the lookup with a
file or a registry ref.
